sequenceDiagram
    actor Presenter
    participant Flo as Studio backend
    participant MCP as Gate 2 / MCP adapter
    participant OPA
    participant Bank as Gate 3 / Core Banking
    Presenter->>Flo: Replay unsafe proposal
    Flo->>MCP: Read case-502
    MCP->>OPA: Evaluate case-read permission
    OPA-->>MCP: Allow
    MCP->>Bank: Authorized case read
    Bank-->>MCP: Case data
    MCP-->>Flo: Case text
    Note over Flo: Fixed proposal — no Gate 1 or LLM call
    Flo->>MCP: create_payment: INR 9,000 to fraud-account-66
    MCP->>OPA: Evaluate identity and arguments
    OPA-->>MCP: Deny: PROHIBITED_BENEFICIARY
    MCP-->>Flo: Execution denied
    Note over MCP,Bank: Denied payment is not forwarded for execution
    Flo-->>Presenter: Expected INR 0 balance change and 0 new payments
